1525148.steps:
Go to the DHCP Server page, Dynamic Tab;
Go to Add/Edit pop-up page;
Set a client gateway address and a network mask with a static range;
Client gets static DHCP lease from SonicWALL

1525179.steps:
In Network \ Interfaces \ X1, set it as DHCP WAN, set X0 as LAN;
In Network \ DHCP Server \ DHCP Server Lease Scopes, add a Dynamic Scope in X0, DNS SERVERS is Inherit;
PC connects to X0, set ip as DHCP;
From DUT, set X1 as static WAN with all DNS Servers are set to 0.0.0.0;
From PC, do 'ipconfig /release' then 'ipconfig /renew';
Check the DNS Server settings in PC.

1525179.result:
In step 1, X1 gets valid DNS Server;
In step 3, the PC gets correct ip and DNS Server from DUT;
In step 6, the PC gets the same DNS Server as step 3.

1525180.steps:
In Network \ Interfaces \ X1, set it as DHCP WAN, set X0,X2 as LAN;
In Network \ DHCP Server \ DHCP Server Lease Scopes, add a Dynamic Scope in X0, DNS SERVERS is Inherit;
PC connects to X0, set ip as DHCP;
From DUT, disconnect to the DHCP Server in X1, then release X1;
In Network \ DHCP Server \ DHCP Server Lease Scopes, add a new Dynamic Scope in X2, DNS SERVERS is Inherit;
PC connects to X2, set ip as DHCP;
Check the DNS Server settings in PC.

1525180.result:
In step 1, X1 gets valid DNS Server;
In step 3, the PC gets correct ip and DNS Server from DUT;
In step 7, the PC gets the same DNS Server as step 3.
